---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "about miri";


---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>

        <p>Back in 1997, I was introduced to the concept of fic while looking up strat guides for FFVII.  By 2000, I was publishing my own fic on egroups and then ff.net (back when you could still post smut there!) while keeping a personal archive on the side, as a response to way too many fan-run archives disappearing off the 'net.  Then Ao3 came along, and I got tired of paying for and maintaining sites, so I let my archive go, too.</p>
        <p>Ao3pocalypse 2026 was a pretty stark reminder of how life used to be, and I miss building sites anyway, so here we are.  The internet was a lot more fun when personal sites were a thing, so I'mma do my part to add to it.</p>

     
</BaseLayout>